id: heavy-suppression-overwhelming-transformation
name: Overwhelming Transformation
order: 3
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
# (1) Draining and Power High lost; Natural (LV2).
aspects: -Draining, -Power High, +Natural (LV2)
description: >
  Even shedding a single layer of your suppression is enough to overwhelm most enemies.
text: >
  Overwhelming Transformation: Even shedding a single layer of your suppression is enough to overwhelm most enemies.
  (1)-[Permanent]: This Transformation loses the Draining and Power High Aspects and gains the Natural (LV2) Aspect.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Apparel Bonus of your Plating by 1(T).
  (3)-[Triggered/Transform, Triggered/Start of Turn]: Gain a stack of Overwhelm.

---

# (2) Plating's Apparel Bonus: the table's.

# (3) Entering it and at the start of your turn: a stack of Overwhelm.
[triggered/transform, effect 3]
overwhelm.stacks += 1;

[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 3]
overwhelm.stacks += 1;
